{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47655","headline":"劝世 · 吕岩","name":"劝世","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一毫之善，与人方便。\n一毫之恶，劝君莫作。\n衣食随缘，自然快乐。\n筭是甚命，问什麽卜。\n欺人是祸，饶人是福。\n天眼昭昭，报应甚速。\n谛听吾言，神钦鬼伏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47655.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47655","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}